+// 36 KiB on-chip RAM; SPL leaves the DDR timing info (struct dram_timing_info) here for TF-A's DDR DVFS
+// service (SAVED_DRAM_TIMING_BASE). Without a setpoint TF-A doesn't install its SGI 8 (FIQ) handler, yet still
